{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d917a65903cd21a6f22863521a3c418348eb40e56af828e80c6ead7682a1d540", "ja": "（ひなたの新しい衣装が届き、試着してもらっている。\nふわふわで可愛らしい感じに仕上がったな）", "zh": "（小日向的新服装送到了，现在正让她试穿。\n做成了蓬松又可爱的感觉呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "7bee0c5c6d0dbe33895e5134382be941c3cad30530198207ae89f510081abb77", "ja": "えへへ、めんこい衣装だねぇ。着てると\nとってもあたたかくて、心までぽかぽかしてくるべさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这套服装真可爱呀。穿上之后特别暖和，连心里都暖洋洋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "1f5466341fcfffaf1962c29191ae0b4b9d6a13ffb7593bd1a5d70ec66a86caf1", "ja": "いつもありがとねぇ、{$P$}。\n新しい衣装をもらうと、やっぱりワクワクするよぉ。", "zh": "一直以来谢谢你呀，{$P$}。\n拿到新服装，果然还是让人好兴奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a8b6323d8911ac964a48f9e749c1a66681a380f72acdc94fac138899abf5bddf", "ja": "それはよかった。\nひなたが喜んでくれて、こっちも嬉しいよ。", "zh": "那太好了。\n看到小日向这么开心，我这边也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "261e651764b217b0c55f28acf3f888a6b0d954c2c5f5067deee41cd8e0b68787", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。この衣装、\n『スノウレター』の歌をイメージしてるんだよね。", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。这套服装，是以《Snow Letter》的歌曲为灵感设计的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "3a3b62e0524717734bfed5009ed16afc1e8637b2fa522246fe825b327aa61f93", "ja": "なんだか、雪景色に似合いそうだなって思ったんだ。\n本当に雪の中で着るのは、大変だけど……。", "zh": "我觉得，这套衣服好像很适合雪景。\n不过真的穿着它在雪地里拍摄，应该会很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "25f4f1d39e70e0ca203bb90842012a1fdf46e1497cc229adfbcce05363469f16", "ja": "雪だるまをいっぱい作ったり、\n一緒に写真を撮ったら、楽しそうじゃないかな？", "zh": "堆好多雪人，再一起拍张照片，不是会很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f78f0aa8de526c6ca26b4d0138fd9b26d3e14038c96124a48177f56d977bb927", "ja": "おお！　それはいい画になるな。ひなたが言うように\n冬らしい季節にはピッタリだと思う。", "zh": "哦！那一定会拍出很棒的照片。就像日向说的，我觉得特别适合这种充满冬日气息的季节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "6a20aa196797ffd325fae59d5310ba307d3f102e24860bfee0c2597ebdf8c70c", "ja": "うん。衣装に着替えてる時に、\nちょっと地元のことを思い出してねぇ。", "zh": "嗯。换衣服的时候，\n我稍微想起了老家的事情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "9275478283186455e137e2fee36c1144fd964ca87c1f353a2c16fb8c0470c64f", "ja": "冬になると雪がたくさん積もるから、\n弟と一緒に、いろんな雪遊びをしたんだ。", "zh": "因为一到冬天就会积起厚厚的雪，\n所以我会和弟弟一起玩各种各样的雪上游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "8b38b35817b7d88949f7cd5f4288de093b511dac44502a188c5da63ea42e8ed8", "ja": "こっちは、あんまり雪が降らないからねぇ。\n劇場のみんなと遊べたら楽しいと思うんだけども。", "zh": "这边不太下雪，所以啊。\n要是能和剧场的大家一起玩雪，应该会很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4b130f6a70fc32946c4e33cd0edb2ed1aee4982c1a949ebb4709eb842da9fc06", "ja": "さすがに北海道と比べるとな……。\nそれに雪が積もると、大変なことも多いんじゃないか？", "zh": "毕竟跟北海道比起来，确实不一样……  \n而且要是积了雪，应该也会有很多麻烦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "27d88397a84920c1cac3a96e1aed35a174711b850e2e94ea98dae9b38d8588a9", "ja": "そうだねぇ。雪かきは、やっぱり大変だべさ。\n一日に何回もしないと、埋まってしまうからね。", "zh": "是啊。铲雪果然很费劲呗。  \n要是不一天铲好几次，都会被雪埋住的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "08c4b996db9bc22e4e1d8bb165cbaa50e78338f25522969843ebabf31903057f", "ja": "でも、かまくら作ったり、雪合戦したり……\n楽しいことも同じくらいあるんだわ。", "zh": "不过，堆雪屋、打雪仗什么的……\n开心的事也同样多着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "31ee33fe3a3f6214b01de8940632ed51098ee9b731820bace16a2c487450bdd8", "ja": "{$P$}も、きっと気に入るよぉ。\nいつか一緒に遊べたらいいねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}肯定也会喜欢的哦。\n要是将来能一起玩就好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "20df2511a1834ed132d5e8eed641f6dbfe55291113397ac637e074f4e2c88703", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。雪が降ったら、\n本場雪国の遊び方を教えてほしいな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。下雪的话，真想让你教教我雪国的正宗玩法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "6688014424e1327fb03766d7f177a7e08e6c7f0501f83ed28cebdca7e8acdf95", "ja": "任せるべさ！　{$P$}が一緒なら\nうんとおっきなかまくらが作れそうだねぇ。", "zh": "包在我身上啦！只要和{$P$}一起，\n感觉就能做出特别大的雪屋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "72ab4b49260c9223c47df89023baed06fa99204cb22328fc38519985f8db8448", "ja": "そんで、劇場のみんなの雪だるまを作って、\n記念撮影したら……いい思い出になるねぇ。えへへ♪", "zh": "然后，堆一个剧场大家的雪人，再拍张纪念照……一定会成为美好的回忆呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0624_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c0cd9bce5280299a38740be814dc55d688a671baae96286b1fa2764df94c2874", "ja": "（楽しそうに語るひなたを見ていると、心があたたかく\nなってくるな。北海道での雪遊び、いつかできるかな）", "zh": "（看着开心地讲述着这些的日向，心里也变得暖暖的。什么时候才能去北海道玩雪呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
